---
import iconGradient from '../../images/icon sistemagis gradient.png';
---

<section class="relative w-full py-20 sm:py-28 px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-12 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="relative rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0f172a] via-[#1e1b4b] to-[#0f172a] p-10 sm:p-16 lg:p-20 text-white overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#8b5cf6]/30">
      <!-- Ambient Glows -->
      <div class="absolute -right-24 -bottom-24 w-96 h-96 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#5194ea]/25 to-[#8b5cf6]/25 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -left-24 -top-24 w-96 h-96 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#8b5cf6]/25 to-[#5194ea]/25 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <!-- Watermark logo motif in background -->
      <div class="absolute right-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-5 pointer-events-none w-80 h-80 hidden lg:block">
        <img src={iconGradient.src} alt="" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#8b5cf6]/20 border border-[#8b5cf6]/35 text-[#c4b5fd] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#8b5cf6] animate-ping"></span>
          Siap Membereskan Masalah Anda
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white">
          Got something complicated?
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#5194ea] to-[#c4b5fd]">
          Let's make it simple. Let's make it magis.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-6 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          Ceritakan kebutuhan sistem bisnis Anda kepada tim kami. Kami akan bantu merumuskan arsitektur yang tepat, estimasi biaya transparan, dan solusi yang beres tuntas.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="px-8 py-4 rounded-xl text-white font-bold text-sm bg-gradient-to-r from-[#5194ea] to-[#8b5cf6] hover:from-[#4382d6] hover:to-[#7c4def] shadow-xl shadow-[#8b5cf6]/30 transition-all hover:scale-105 inline-flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Start a Project</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Sistemagis%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20untuk%20konsultasi%20kebutuhan%20digital%20bisnis%20kami..."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-7 py-4 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-semibold text-sm border border-white/20 transition-all hover:scale-105 inline-flex items-center gap-2"
          >
            <span>Talk to Us via WhatsApp</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#8b5cf6]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.625 12a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm0 0H8.25m4.125 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm0 0H12m4.125 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0zm0 0h-.375M21 12c0 4.556-4.03 8.25-9 8.25a9.764 9.764 0 01-2.555-.337A5.972 5.972 0 015.41 20.97a.75.75 0 01-.81-.97 4.502 4.502 0 00.916-2.434C3.89 16.29 3 14.26 3 12c0-4.556 4.03-8.25 9-8.25s9 3.694 9 8.25z" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
